          <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">What is the strongest nicotine pouch in the world?</summary>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;">Shiro and Killa hold the highest market positions, with some variants reaching up to 50mg of nicotine per pouch—designed for experienced users and former heavy smokers. These ultra-strength options are primarily available in Scandinavia and select European markets.</p>
        </details>

