          <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">Is 50mg nicotine safe?</summary>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;">50mg nicotine pouches carry significant health risks and are intended only for users with established high nicotine tolerance. Current research suggests such high concentrations increase risks of dependence and cardiovascular effects (<a href="https://www.rcplondon.ac.uk/projects/outputs/nicotine-and-e-cigarettes-2016-position-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Royal College of Physicians (2016)</a>); they should never be used by beginners or those with heart conditions.</p>
        </details>

        <details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">What is stronger than ZYN?</summary>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;">VELO, ON!, Shiro, and Killa all offer strength tiers exceeding ZYN's maximum of 6mg per pouch. <a href="/brands/velo" style="color: hsl(var(--primary));">VELO offers up to 8mg</a>, while Nordic brands like Shiro and Killa reach 25–50mg for users seeking maximum nicotine delivery.</p>
        </details>

        <div class="not-prose grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-8">
          {find('siberia-slim') && <BlogProductCard product={find('siberia-slim')} />}
          {find('white-fox-full-charge') && <BlogProductCard product={find('white-fox-full-charge')} />}
          {find('loop-red-chili-melon-hyper-strong') && <BlogProductCard product={find('loop-red-chili-melon-hyper-strong')} />}
          {find('loop-habanero-mint-hyper-strong') && <BlogProductCard product={find('loop-habanero-mint-hyper-strong')} />}
          {find('velo-freezing-peppermint-ultra-es') && <BlogProductCard product={find('velo-freezing-peppermint-ultra-es')} />}
          {find('white-fox-black-edition') && <BlogProductCard product={find('white-fox-black-edition')} />}
